==Battleground==
*2 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Project A]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*10 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Corporal Weyland]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Spacefish Jones]] spawns as the boss after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*10 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 130 seconds<sup>3,900f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try to have at least one chapter's worth of [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. With said [[Treasure]]s at 500% or above, the easiest way to beat this stage is to lure the initial Shibalien Elites and Star Pengs close to the [[Cat Base]], then start spamming meatshields to protect [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] as he rushes them down. From there, try to take out the enemy base as fast as possible before more threats spawn, piling on DPS with units like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]].

If you can't rush the stage, use [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance units]] and [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] to snipe Le'Solar and Project A, while using [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] to stop the [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] from destroying your frontline. Use [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], then send in Awakened Bahamut when Spacefish Jones is exposed and all the peons are gone.

